            "review_title": "Review at Sapa May Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Mr.U.Li\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nNice time at the Sapa May, Personal was very helpful\nApr 2026 • Couples\nWe had a very pleasant stay at the Sapa May Restaurant and Hotel. I would especially like to commend the staff – everyone was consistently very friendly, attentive, and helpful. We immediately felt welcome, and any questions or concerns were addressed quickly and easily.\n\nThe atmosphere was cozy and relaxing, just right after a long day in Sapa. Overall, it offered excellent value for money.\n\nAll in all, a clear recommendation – we would definitely come back!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 15, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
